<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia sugar hit by cyclone/losses unclear.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia sugar hit by cyclone/losses unclear.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's sugar crop would be significantly affected by cyclone Justin but the full extent of losses would not be known for weeks, cane industry officials told Reuters.</p>
</text>
